M45:eq:tube-10.statement:
[M45; research/openai_manuscript/Ambiently-homeomorphic-isolated-hypersurface-germs-in-C4-with-multiplicities-four-and-five-September-27-2026/build/sections/05-boundary.tex:296-304; equation] \begin{aligned}
h_p&=-\chi R_p,&
